### ============================================================================
### NOTES:
### ============================================================================
###
### Before running these tests:
### 1. Start the Spring Boot application: ./mvnw.cmd spring-boot:run
### 2. Ensure SQL Server database is running with SportsCenterDB schema
### 3. Replace @memberToken with actual token from login endpoint
### 4. Replace @managerToken with token from a CENTER_MANAGER user
### 5. Adjust memberId, packageId, and classId based on your database data
###
### Expected Results:
### - Flow 1: Subscription should return 201 with subscription details
### - Flow 2: Booking should return 201 with booking details
### - Flow 3: Revenue report should return 200 with BigDecimal total (Manager only)
###
### ============================================================================
